**Rationale:** The activity describes recording incoming shipments from suppliers into the system at the warehouse stage, before invoicing occurs. This is a goods receipt process, not an invoicing process. The **Material Receipt Inbound API** from SAP S/4HANA is purpose-built for creating and managing goods receipt transactions against purchase orders—exactly the physical receipt logging requirement described. This precedes invoice processing and is the standard mechanism for recording what has physically arrived at the warehouse.
